      "description": "<p>You master the art of creating and deploying traps. Each time you acquire this Skill, you progressively learn to create better traps. You can only learn <strong>two traps</strong> from each corresponding Skill Level (SL) (see Facet).</p><p>At the start of a conflict, you may deploy <strong>one</strong> trap you know before the first round. Spend <strong>【IP equal to the trap's SL】</strong> and <strong>【5 MP】</strong> for one creature, <strong>【10 MP】</strong> for two, or <strong>【15 MP】</strong> for three. Each target performs an Opposed <strong>【DEX + INS】</strong> Check against your <strong>【DEX + INS + SL】</strong>. Those who succeed escape the trap.</p>",
